        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Requirements",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You can perceive at least 12 allies or friendly bystanders encouraging you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This elegant crown of laurels can be worn on the head, atop a helmet, or even wrapped around the neck as a torc, signaling the wearer's athletic achievements in a past competition. When you Activate the laurels, you draw strength from your adoring crowd and gain a +1 status bonus to the triggering check. If you critically succeed at the check, you gain 2 temporary Hit Points that last for 1 minute."
          }
        ]
      }
