          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Trigger",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You succeed at, fail, or critically fail a recovery check while "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "c0cd649a-7029-5174-a5b4-678f51598dec"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " by 1."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This pyrefowl feather, accentuated with beadwork, stores a spark of the bird's self-healing power. When you Activate the token, you reduce the triggering recovery check's DC by 1, potentially improving your check's degree of success. You also gain 5 temporary Hit Points that last for 1 minute. You can Activate this talisman even while "
          },
