  {
    "id": "a8d4ab41-8ed5-5c32-a023-ebe35fa56a7a",
    "pack": "myth-speakers",
    "kind": "consumable",
    "slug": "consumable:soldiers-syrup-greater",
    "name": "Soldier's Syrup (Greater)",
    "level": 12,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["consumable", "magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "myth-speakers"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This thick syrup sweetens potions and creates a distinctive, metallic flavor associated with the festival days in Dhuraxilis. Partygoers are fond of mixing "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soldier's syrup",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " with potions to extend their release."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activating a dose of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soldier's syrup",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " requires you to combine it with another consumable potion that takes 1 action to activate. After swirling the mixture for a few moments, you must either imbibe the augmented potion within 1 minute, or the potion reverts to its unaugmented state. The potion's level cannot exceed that of the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soldier's syrup",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " it is mixed with, otherwise the syrup is wasted."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When consumed, a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soldier's syrup",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "–augmented potion does not immediately grant its benefits to you. Instead, you can activate the potion within the next hour as a single action, which has the concentrate trait. You can have only one "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soldier's syrup",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "–augmented potion consumed at a time; consuming a second one renders the first one inert. If you do not activate the potion within 1 hour, the potion spoils inside you, and you become "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "5aa15fa8-99a7-56a4-8237-f605177275dd",
            "label": "Enfeebled 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " for 24 hours."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.qnBpdjITfJFSO7T8"
    },
    "data": {
      "price": {
        "coins": {
          "gp": 400
        }
      },
      "bulk": "light",
      "category": "other",
      "usage": {
        "type": "held",
        "hands": "one"
      }
    }
  },
